Model study on simulated drops, not data.  Rules A (fixed 3%, c* -1.61), B (measured misread, c* -2.21, NS above 10% measured),
AM1 / AM2 = proposals only (B + plateau h in STEP / in both families).  Protocol droplet_sim2.protocol, 25 drops x 8 levels, 128 controls.
cells: 87 counting+drying nulls, 27 exclusion_bak curves, 27 counting-with-floor.  Runs per cell-condition: calibration 300, evaluation 400, plateau map 600.

Calibration: c* = lowest 5th percentile of L over cells x conditions (>= 50 eligible runs: scorable, range >= 0.4, z <= 1.645)
